  _lines:
  - _speakerName: Tablet III
    _dialogueText: Now the Great Worm awakens.
  - _speakerName: Tablet III
    _dialogueText: Its hunger grows with every tremor. The crystals pulse with its
      heartbeat, and the ruins shake beneath its wrath. Should it rise from the depths,
      nothing upon the surface will endure.
